test "rank1275: promoted widths cannot overflow the int the sum is computed in"
  lang c
  file graphics.c
  reject VYQL-NUM-014
  code
  ```
  typedef struct { unsigned int width, height; } Image;

  static void
  compose_offset_bounds_check(unsigned short dest_x, unsigned short src_width, Image *img) {
      unsigned short width = src_width ? src_width : img->width;
      if (dest_x + width > img->width) {
          return;
      }
  }
  ```
